    "title": "Event download system",
    "pageid": 2692,
    "revid": 5146,
    "text": {
      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice-template\" style=\"text-align:justify;background:#fff7f7;margin-left:2%;padding:0 1em;border:1px solid #b77;margin-bottom:10px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p>The title of this article is <i><b>conjectural</b></i>; an official name for the article's subject has not been found, so it has been given a fitting title by editors. If there is an official name, it is requested that the article <b>Event download system</b> be <a href=\"/wiki/Special:MovePage/Event_download_system\" title=\"Special:MovePage/Event download system\">moved</a> to the correct name.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>event download system</b> is a new system of handling <a href=\"/wiki/Events\" title=\"Events\">events</a> introduced in <a href=\"/wiki/Version_history#2.2.3\" title=\"Version history\">version 2.2.3</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i>. Before version 2.2.3, events were automatically part of the game, and did not require downloading. This also meant that the events are part of the game and dependent on the version.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effects\">Effects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEvent_download_system%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 115px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/d/df/NewEventIcon.png/revision/latest?cb=20150721185509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Icon to prompt event download.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/d/df/NewEventIcon.png/revision/latest?cb=20150721185509\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"106\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"NewEventIcon.png\" data-image-key=\"NewEventIcon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:NewEventIcon.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Icon to prompt event download.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The new system allows the game to download events from <a href=\"/wiki/Sinsiroad\" title=\"Sinsiroad\">Sinsiroad</a>'s servers. This means that events are no longer tied to the game versions itself, allowing new events to happen without Sinsiroad having to update the game. As long as the game is running version 2.2.3 or newer, the current event will always be available, provided an internet connection is available.\n</p>\n<table class=\"navtemplate\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#cc9933\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Events\" title=\"Events\">Events</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th width=\"64px\" style=\"background:#ddd\"><abbr title=\"These events were included as part of the game itself.\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px dotted; cursor: help;\">Pre-download system</abbr>\n</th>\n<td style=\"background:#dd\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Cherry Blossom event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2hlcnJ5X0Jsb3Nzb21fZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Cherry Blossom event</span> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/Season_2_update_event\" title=\"Season 2 update event\">Season 2 update event</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Alchemy_Lab_event\" title=\"Mystic Alchemy Lab event\">Mystic Alchemy Lab event</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th width=\"64px\" style=\"background:#ddd\"><abbr title=\"These events are not included as part of the game. They use the new event download system introduced in the version 2.2.3 update.\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px dotted; cursor: help;\">Post-download system</abbr>\n</th>\n<td style=\"background:#dd\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halak_Birthday_event\" title=\"Halak Birthday event\">Halak Birthday event</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/300000_DL_Thanks_event\" title=\"300000 DL Thanks event\">300000 DL Thanks event</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/2015_Summer_Event_Part._1\" title=\"2015 Summer Event Part. 1\">2015 Summer Event Part. 1</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/2015_Summer_Event_Part._2\" title=\"2015 Summer Event Part. 2\">2015 Summer Event Part. 2</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/2015_Summer_Event_Part._3\" title=\"2015 Summer Event Part. 3\">2015 Summer Event Part. 3</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/Succubus_appeared!\" title=\"Succubus appeared!\">Succubus appeared!</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/Fox_burrow_Open!\" title=\"Fox burrow Open!\">Fox burrow Open!</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/2015_Halloween_Party\" title=\"2015 Halloween Party\">2015 Halloween Party</a>&#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/500000_DL_Thanks_Event\" title=\"500000 DL Thanks Event\">500000 DL Thanks Event</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><div align=\"center\"><b>This template is missing data from past events.<br />Know any? Leave a suggestion <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://potionmaker.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Navbox-events?action=edit&amp;section=new&amp;useeditor=source\">here</a>, or <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://potionmaker.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Navbox-events?action=edit&amp;useeditor=source\">edit this template</a> yourself.</b></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261012145603\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 25/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2118/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.434      1 -total\n 73.46%    9.134      1 Template:Conjecture\n 14.33%    1.782      1 Template:Navbox-events\n 10.93%    1.359      1 Template:PM\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_potionmaker783:pcache:idhash:2692-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261012145603 and revision id 5146. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
